<title>BELGIUM: EU announces Cape Verde wheat aid tender result.</title>
<headline>EU announces Cape Verde wheat aid tender result.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has announced that Lecureur of Paris successfully tendered for the supply of 4,000 tonnes of common wheat as food aid to the Cape Verde islands, a notice in Tuesday's EU Official Journal says.</p>
<p>The journal, obtained on Wednesday, gives the awarded price as 183.57 ecus per tonne.</p>
</text>
